(71, 'All employees are requested to enter into the system the work equipment currently in their possession.', '<p>Dear colleagues, although some of you had previously entered certain items, I would like to kindly request each one of you to once again record all the work equipment you currently possess in the system, under ‘Assets file.’ </p><p>Thank you!</p>', 'general', '1,2,3,4,6,8,71,72,73,74,75,76,77,78,79,80,81,82,101,105,106,107,108,109,110,112,113,114', '105,2,81,109,76', 7, '2026-03-23 16:00:18', '2026-04-07 15:31:24', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(72, 'To Inform.', '<p><strong>Dear ED,</strong></p><p><strong><br></strong></p><p>As you had requested that to purchase <strong>Agenda</strong> with wooden covers, we coordinated with our supplier. However, wherever he checked, she found that these covers were not available now. She even went to inquire at Amasezera Community Banking to ask where they had sourced the ones they provided us, but upon arrival he found they were already out of stock. They informed her that new stock might arrive at the end of this month.</p><p>Therefore, due to these reasons, we are waiting for its to become available. Once covers arrive, we will immediately issue a purchase order for her.</p><p><br></p><p>Thank you!</p>', 'general', '5', '5', 7, '2026-03-23 17:35:23', '2026-03-23 17:50:39', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(73, 'Sharing assign invitation letter', '<p>Dear Team,</p><p><br></p><p>I hope you are doing well.</p><p>This is an urgent reminder that the signed invitation letters for both the induction training for new leaders and the General Assembly are attached. Kindly ensure that these documents are shared with all participants <strong>no later than today</strong>.</p><p>Additionally, I kindly request that you prepare and share a simple certificate <strong>by the end of today</strong>, so that everything is ready for Thursday morning.</p><p>Thank you very much for your prompt attention and understanding.</p>', 'general', '6,7', NULL, 5, '2026-03-24 10:04:37', '2026-03-24 10:04:37', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
