ght Accent 1\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"47\" Name=\"List Table 2 Accent 1\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"48\" Name=\"List Table 3 Accent 1\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"49\" Name=\"List Table 4 Accent 1\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"50\" Name=\"List Table 5 Dark Accent 1\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"51\" Name=\"List Table 6 Colorful Accent 1\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"52\" Name=\"List Table 7 Colorful Accent 1\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"46\" Name=\"List Table 1 Light Accent 2\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"47\" Name=\"List Table 2 Accent 2\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"48\" Name=\"List Table 3 Accent 2\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"49\" Name=\"List Table 4 Accent 2\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"50\" Name=\"List Table 5 Dark Accent 2\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"51\" Name=\"List Table 6 Colorful Accent 2\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"52\" Name=\"List Table 7 Colorful Accent 2\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"46\" Name=\"List Table 1 Light Accent 3\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"47\" Name=\"List Table 2 Accent 3\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"48\" Name=\"List Table 3 Accent 3\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"49\" Name=\"List Table 4 Accent 3\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"50\" Name=\"List Table 5 Dark Accent 3\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"51\" Name=\"List Table 6 Colorful Accent 3\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"52\" Name=\"List Table 7 Colorful Accent 3\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"46\" Name=\"List Table 1 Light Accent 4\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"47\" Name=\"List Table 2 Accent 4\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"48\" Name=\"List Table 3 Accent 4\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"49\" Name=\"List Table 4 Accent 4\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"50\" Name=\"List Table 5 Dark Accent 4\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"51\" Name=\"List Table 6 Colorful Accent 4\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"52\" Name=\"List Table 7 Colorful Accent 4\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"46\" Name=\"List Table 1 Light Accent 5\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"47\" Name=\"List Table 2 Accent 5\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"48\" Name=\"List Table 3 Accent 5\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"49\" Name=\"List Table 4 Accent 5\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"50\" Name=\"List Table 5 Dark Accent 5\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"51\" Name=\"List Table 6 Colorful Accent 5\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"52\" Name=\"List Table 7 Colorful Accent 5\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"46\" Name=\"List Table 1 Light Accent 6\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"47\" Name=\"List Table 2 Accent 6\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"48\" Name=\"List Table 3 Accent 6\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"49\" Name=\"List Table 4 Accent 6\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"50\" Name=\"List Table 5 Dark Accent 6\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"51\" Name=\"List Table 6 Colorful Accent 6\"/> <w:LsdException Locked=\"false\" Priority=\"52\" Name=\"List Table 7 Colorful Accent 6\"/> </w:LatentStyles> </xml><![endif]--> <!--[if gte mso 10]> <style> /* Style Definitions */ table.MsoNormalTable {mso-style-name:\"Table Normal\"; mso-tstyle-rowband-size:0; mso-tstyle-colband-size:0; mso-style-noshow:yes; mso-style-priority:99; mso-style-parent:\"\"; mso-padding-alt:0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; mso-para-margin-top:0cm; mso-para-margin-right:0cm; mso-para-margin-bottom:8.0pt; mso-para-margin-left:0cm; line-height:107%; mso-pagination:widow-orphan; font-size:11.0pt; font-family:\"Calibri\",sans-serif; mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;} </style> <![endif]--> <!--StartFragment--> <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><!--[if !supportLists]--><b>1.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </b><!--[endif]--><b>The activities done in 2Q<o:p></o:p></b></p> <p style=\"text-align:justify\">1.RWVCA was provided one coaster for transportation our partners during the 32nd Commemoration of the Genocide against the Tutsi in 1994</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">2.We visited members across 12 districts: Kamonyi, Muhanga, Huye, Nyamagabe, Rusizi, Nyamasheke, Karongi, Rubavu, Nyabihu, Musanze, Gasabo, and Nyagatare.</p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">3.Membership recovery, 20 members totaled 7,375,000 RWF, and two new members joined the Association.</p> <p style=\"text-align:justify\">4.We monitored the implementation of desk repair activities in Bugesera, Rubavu, and Musanze Districts, and also followed up on the new desks produced in Gasabo and Kicukiro.<o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\">5.<span style=\"text-align: start;\">During this quarter, we have already purchased food, and hygiene supplies worth 2,326,520 RWF, and we plan to close the quarter with total expenditures of 2,826,520 RWF, compared to the 6 million RWF that had been budgeted.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"text-align: start;\">6.</span><span style=\"text-align: start;\">Through the Irembo system, we requested a reduction in electricity costs for five members.</span><span style=\"text-align: start;\">We are still waiting for feedback.</span></p><!--StartFragment--><!--EndFragment--><!--StartFragment--><!--EndFragment--><!--StartFragment--><!--EndFragment--> <p style=\"text-align:justify\"><!--[if !supportLists]-->2.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <!--[endif]--><b>Planned Activities for Q3</b><o:p></o:p></p> <ol start=\"1\" type=\"1\"> <li style=\" text-align:justify\">We will continue visiting both existing members and prospective members.<o:p></o:p></li> <li style=\" text-align:justify\">We will continue collecting contributions from members who have not yet paid.<o:p></o:p></li> <li style=\" text-align:justify\">We will organize a meeting with the presidents of the ICPCs.<o:p></o:p></li> <li style=\" text-align:justify\">We will conduct training sessions for women and youth on business and financial management.<o:p></o:p></li> <li style=\" text-align:justify\">We will continue registering all operators engaged in the tree business value chain in Rwanda.<o:p></o:p></li> <li style=\" text-align:justify\">We will collaborate with colleagues on the RPL program.<o:p></o:p></li> <li style=\" text-align:justify\">While we receive a purchase order for desks, I will monitor its implementation.<o:p></o:p></li><li style=\" text-align:justify\"><!--StartFragment-->We will continue advocating for a reduction in electricity costs for members engaged in carpentry business.<!--EndFragment--></li> </ol> <!--EndFragment--></div><!--EndFragment--><div><br></div><div>Thank you.</div>', 'general', '1', NULL, 7, '2026-06-15 14:01:58', '2026-06-15 14:01:58', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(169, 'Notification of Sick Leave', '<!--StartFragment--><div style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">Dear Hr</div><div style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">I am writing to inform you that I have been granted a 5-day medical leave due to illness, starting from June 16, 2026, until June 20, 2026.</div><div style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">Please find attached the official medical certificate.</div><div style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">I will ensure to catch up on any pending tasks as soon as I return. Thank you for your understanding.</div><div style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">Best regards,</div><div style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\"><br></div><div style=\"color: rgb(68, 68, 68);\">Moses Niyitegeka</div><!--EndFragment-->', 'general', '1', NULL, 101, '2026-06-16 09:42:45', '2026-06-16 09:42:45', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/communications/1781595765_092c1b386ee6d99c.pdf', ''),
(170, 'Impamvu nakoze refund', 'Mwiriwe neza? Uyu munsi nakoze refund ya facture ifite nimero ya 802&amp;813 nayikoze kubera ko umuclient yazanye imbaho yakuramo nkeya akazanga.', 'general', '4,3,7', NULL, 74, '2026-06-17 20:32:46', '2026-06-17 20:32:46', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(171, 'FOOD REQUEST', 'Claudine mwaramutse neza?<div>Nagirango nkugezeho requsition y\'ibizakenerwa mu cyumweru gitaha,twakoze jyewe na Zainabu.</div><div>Murakoze.</div>', 'general', '4', NULL, 7, '2026-06-19 10:12:07', '2026-06-19 10:12:07', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/communications/1781856727_b8e0ac26c1055477.xlsx', ''),
(172, 'Gusaba guidance kukugura camera z\'umutekano', 'Danny mwaramutse neza?<div><br></div><div>Turashaka kugura camera z\'umutekano, muri rusange nabonye dushobora gukenera enye (4)</div><div><br></div><div>Ndagirango umfashe kundebera ubwoko bwa camera nziza kandi zikora neza, na specifacation zazo kugirango tuzatangire procedure yo kuzigura ariko tuzi icyo dushaka.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>Kumugereka nguhaye ibyo nari nkuye kuri AI wareba niba harimo ibyo wakwifashisha. Byaba byiza dushatse camera nziza ariko kandi zitaduhenze.</div><div>Merci.</div>', 'general', '2', NULL, 7, '2026-06-19 11:53:06', '2026-06-19 11:53:07', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/communications/1781862787_29ca975189da4128.docx', ''),
(173, 'Gusaba guidance kukugura camera z\'umutekano', 'Danny mwaramutse neza?<div><br></div><div>Turashaka kugura camera z\'umutekano, muri rusange nabonye dushobora gukenera enye (4)</div><div><br></div><div>Ndagirango umfashe kundebera ubwoko bwa camera nziza kandi zikora neza, na specifacation zazo kugirango tuzatangire procedure yo kuzigura ariko tuzi icyo dushaka.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>Kumugereka nguhaye ibyo nari nkuye kuri AI wareba niba harimo ibyo wakwifashisha. Byaba byiza dushatse camera nziza ariko kandi zitaduhenze.</div><div>Merci.</div>', 'general', '2', NULL, 7, '2026-06-19 11:54:21', '2026-06-19 11:54:21', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/communications/1781862861_a4e98fe819c4bbc2.docx', ''),
(174, 'Gusaba guidance kukugura camera z\'umutekano', 'Danny mwaramutse neza?<div><br></div><div>Turashaka kugura camera z\'umutekano, muri rusange nabonye dushobora gukenera enye (4)</div><div><br></div><div>Ndagirango umfashe kundebera ubwoko bwa camera nziza kandi zikora neza, na specifacation zazo kugirango tuzatangire procedure yo kuzigura ariko tuzi icyo dushaka.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>Kumugereka nguhaye ibyo nari nkuye kuri AI wareba niba harimo ibyo wakwifashisha. Byaba byiza dushatse camera nziza ariko kandi zitaduhenze.</div><div>Merci.</div>', 'general', '2', NULL, 7, '2026-06-19 11:54:26', '2026-06-19 11:54:26', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/communications/1781862866_1cfd93c9ad0e930a.docx', ''),
(175, 'Gusaba guidance kukugura camera z\'umutekano', 'Danny mwaramutse neza?<div><br></div><div>Turashaka kugura camera z\'umutekano, muri rusange nabonye dushobora gukenera enye (4)</div><div><br></div><div>Ndagirango umfashe kundebera ubwoko bwa camera nziza kandi zikora neza, na specifacation zazo kugirango tuzatangire procedure yo kuzigura ariko tuzi icyo dushaka.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>Kumugereka nguhaye ibyo nari nkuye kuri AI wareba niba harimo ibyo wakwifashisha. Byaba byiza dushatse camera nziza ariko kandi zitaduhenze.</div><div>Merci.</div>', 'general', '2', NULL, 7, '2026-06-19 11:54:39', '2026-06-19 11:54:39', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/communications/1781862879_d5f0000f4d472cd9.docx', ''),
(176, 'lnvoice issue', 'Mwiriwe neza,<div><br></div><div>lmpamvu: gusaba gukora refund.</div><div><br></div><div>Mbandikiye mbasaba ko mwa nyemerera gukora refund ya fagitire yakozwe kuwa 17 Kamena 2026.</div><div><br></div><div>Nakoze fagitire yirusizi nkuko mwabinsabyeko nabamfasha umukozi uhakorera, gukora fagitire,</div><div>ni mururwo rwego nakoze fagitire ariko isohoka yanditseho inshuro ebyiri (2) zimbaho zagombaga kujyaho.</div><div><br></div><div>nukuvugango yagombaga kuba iriho imbaho magana atandatu 600 isohoka iriho imbaho magana atandatu 600 inshuro ebyiri,&nbsp; ziba igihumbi magana abiri 1200.</div><div><br></div><div>Mwanyemerera kuyikorera refund tugakora indi fagitire yanditse neza.</div><div><br></div><div>Murakoze cyane, Mugire amahoro.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Anastase NTIRENGANYA</div><div><br></div><div>Site: Karongi - Rutsiro</div>', 'general', '7,3,73', NULL, 112, '2026-06-19 23:14:01', '2026-06-19 23:14:01', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/communications/1781903641_05361fe32f729587.jpeg', ''),
(177, 'Permission Request', '<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"isSelectedEnd\">Dear HR,<br><br>I kindly request permission to visit my bank to resolve an issue related to my account, which requires my personal presence.</p><p>Thank you for your consideration.</p><!--EndFragment-->', 'permission', '1', NULL, 6, '2026-06-22 15:27:46', '2026-06-22 15:27:46', '2026-06-22 15:45:00', '2026-06-22 17:00:00', NULL, NULL),
(178, 'REQUESTV VEHICLE RAI 905C', 'Dear Emmanuel ,<div><br></div><div>Ndasaba imodoka&nbsp; yo kumfasha kujya kuri RRA mukibazo kijyanye na declaration</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Murakoze !</div>', 'general', '7', NULL, 3, '2026-06-23 09:50:07', '2026-06-23 09:50:07', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(179, 'Updates on managing members through the RWVCA Portal', '<b>Dear Emmy</b>,<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;<div>I hope you are doing well.&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>In the RWVCA Portal under the Members section, I have finalized integrating the feedback you shared about adding the membership payment year and registration status fields, as well as Gogo’s feedback to include the member’s role in RWVCA. You can log in and test to ensure everything is in place. For already registered members, you will need to edit their details to update the data as needed.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><br></div><div>Thanks.&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>', 'general', '5,6,7', NULL, 2, '2026-06-23 16:47:05', '2026-06-23 16:47:05', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(180, 'Request for a permission', 'Dear ED,&nbsp;<div>Ndasaba uruhushya rwo kujya kwa muganga ndumva ntameze neza.</div><div>Murakoze.</div>', 'permission', '5', NULL, 1, '2026-06-24 15:27:28', '2026-06-24 15:27:28', '2026-06-24 15:45:00', '2026-06-24 17:00:00', NULL, NULL),
(181, 'IKIBAZO MFITE KURI SITE YA BISHENYI', 'Mwiriwe neza? Ndizerako mumeze neza,hano bishenyi ikibazo cyo gupakurura imbaho nijoro kiracyakomeje ntago bagipakurura kumanywa bazana imbaho nijoro bigatuma ntamenya umubare wimbaho zapakuruwe hari nabambwira ko batapakuruye bitewe nuko bapakurura nijoro ntahari nabasabaga ko mwamfasha iki kibazo kigakemuka kuko&nbsp; byazatuma umusaruro utaboneka kandi tugeze mugihe cyiza cyo gukora.<div><br></div><div>MURAKOZE.</div>', 'general', '1,7', '7', 74, '2026-07-01 12:39:23', '2026-07-02 16:55:08', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(182, 'ADDITIONAL TRANSPORTATION COST', 'Good afternoon, <div>I hope you are doing well.</div><div>I am writing to inform you about the additional transportation cost you asked me to calculate. after reviewing my daily expenses. I found that extra cost is 2,900RWF per day.</div><div>Previously, when I was travelling to Gisozi I spent 1,250RWF per day on transport each day.</div><div>However, here in Bishenyi my daily transportation is 4,150RWF per day. This is because I have to take motorcycle taxi for 3,000RWF every morning, I can\'t take bus because here at Bishenyi start to unload timber at</div><div>6:00 am.</div><div>Therefore, the additional transportation cost amount is 2900RWF per day.</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you for understanding.</div>', 'general', '1', NULL, 74, '2026-07-01 20:45:27', '2026-07-01 20:45:27', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(183, 'TEST', 'Test', 'general', '74', NULL, 2, '2026-07-02 09:58:07', '2026-07-02 09:58:07', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(184, 'Request for permission to visit the bank', '<b>Dear HR,</b>&nbsp;&nbsp;<br><br><div>I hope you are doing well!&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>I am writing to request permission to visit the bank (Amasezerano Community Bank).&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>Thank you.&nbsp;&nbsp;</div>', 'permission', '1', NULL, 2, '2026-07-02 12:12:00', '2026-07-02 12:12:00', '2026-07-02 16:30:00', '2026-07-02 17:00:00', NULL, NULL),
(185, 'Request for Permission to Visit the Bank Again', 'Dear HR,<div><br><div>With reference to my previous permission request to visit the bank, I kindly request your permission once again to return to the bank to fulfill the remaining requirements they requested.</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you for your understanding.</div><div>Kind regards,</div></div>', 'permission', '1', NULL, 2, '2026-07-03 07:17:32', '2026-07-03 07:17:32', '2026-07-03 09:00:00', '2026-07-03 10:30:00', NULL, NULL),
(186, 'Kumenyesha', 'Nshuti zange,<div><br></div><div>Bimaze kugaragara ko imodoka iva hano kukazi mutamenyesheje aho mugiye kandi biri mu nsingano zanyu kubimenyekanisha</div><div>Ndagirango mbasabe nkabakozi bagenzi bange kandi mbinginge mu byubahiro byanyu mwese, umuntu ukeneye imodoka yakazi mugihe agiye munshingano z\'akazi akwiye kubimenyekanisha ko akeneye imodoka kandi akamenyekanisha aho agiye nigihe ari bugarurire imodoka kukazi. Mugihe cyose imodoka izagenda mutabimenyesheje,uwayijyanye azirengera ingaruka z\'ikibazo cyose cyaba. Murakoze.</div><div><div><br></div></div>', 'general', '8,2,6', NULL, 7, '2026-07-03 16:18:25', '2026-07-03 16:18:25', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `communications` (`id`, `title`, `description`, `communication_type`, `users`, `viewed_users`, `created_by`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `start_time`, `end_time`, `attachment_url`, `link`) VALUES
(187, 'kumenyesha', '<!--StartFragment-->Nshuti zange,<div>Bimaze kugaragara ko imodoka iva hano kukazi mutamenyesheje aho mugiye kandi biri mu nsingano zanyu kubimenyekanisha</div><div>Ndagirango mbasabe nkabakozi bagenzi bange kandi mbinginge mu byubahiro byanyu mwese, umuntu ukeneye imodoka yakazi mugihe agiye munshingano z\'akazi akwiye kubimenyekanisha ko akeneye imodoka kandi akamenyekanisha aho agiye nigihe ari bugarurire imodoka kukazi. Mugihe cyose imodoka izagenda mutabimenyesheje,uwayijyanye azirengera ingaruka z\'ikibazo cyose cyaba.Murakoze.</div><!--EndFragment-->', 'general', '1', NULL, 7, '2026-07-03 16:20:07', '2026-07-03 16:20:07', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(188, 'kumenyesha', '<!--StartFragment-->Nshuti zange,<div><br></div><div>Bimaze kugaragara ko imodoka iva hano kukazi mutamenyesheje aho mugiye kandi biri mu nsingano zanyu kubimenyekanisha</div><div>Ndagirango mbasabe nkabakozi bagenzi bange kandi mbinginge mu byubahiro byanyu mwese, umuntu ukeneye imodoka yakazi mugihe agiye munshingano z\'akazi akwiye kubimenyekanisha ko akeneye imodoka kandi akamenyekanisha aho agiye nigihe ari bugarurire imodoka kukazi. Mugihe cyose imodoka izagenda mutabimenyesheje,uwayijyanye azirengera ingaruka z\'ikibazo cyose cyaba. Murakoze.</div><!--EndFragment-->', 'general', '3', NULL, 7, '2026-07-03 16:21:06', '2026-07-03 16:21:06', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(189, 'kumenyesha', '<!--StartFragment-->Nshuti zange,<div><br></div><div>Bimaze kugaragara ko imodoka iva hano kukazi mutamenyesheje aho mugiye kandi biri mu nsingano zanyu kubimenyekanisha</div><div>Ndagirango mbasabe nkabakozi bagenzi bange kandi mbinginge mu byubahiro byanyu mwese, umuntu ukeneye imodoka yakazi mugihe agiye munshingano z\'akazi akwiye kubimenyekanisha ko akeneye imodoka kandi akamenyekanisha aho agiye nigihe ari bugarurire imodoka kukazi. Mugihe cyose imodoka izagenda mutabimenyesheje,uwayijyanye azirengera ingaruka z\'ikibazo cyose cyaba. Murakoze.</div><!--EndFragment-->', 'general', '102,103,115,104', NULL, 7, '2026-07-03 16:23:36', '2026-07-03 16:23:36', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(190, 'kumenyesha gahunda yo gutwara Gloriose', 'Dear MUHIRWA<div><br></div><div>Ndagirango nkumenyeshe ko ejo kuwa 04/07/2026 <!--StartFragment-->mbere ya sasita&nbsp;<!--EndFragment-->&nbsp;,&nbsp;uzajya gutwara Gloriose agiye guherekeza abashyitsi.</div><div>Uze kuvugana nawe akumenyeshe isaha uzamugereraho.</div><div><br></div><div>NB: Uzamenyesha igihe wamufatiye n\'igihe wagaruriye imodoka kukazi.&nbsp;</div><div>&nbsp; &nbsp; Urakoze.</div>', 'general', '102', NULL, 7, '2026-07-03 16:36:35', '2026-07-03 16:36:35', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(191, 'gusaba kumenyesha isaha', 'Dear Gloriose,<div><br></div><div>Namenyesheje MUHIRWA ko ejo azaza kugufata kugirango ujye guherekeza abashyitsi, uze kumumenyesha isaha azaziraho kukureba.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>Murakoze.</div>', 'general', '6', NULL, 7, '2026-07-03 16:41:25', '2026-07-03 16:41:25', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(192, 'Plan visit at Bishenyi site', '<!--StartFragment--><strong>Dear ED,</strong>&nbsp;<div>&nbsp;The issue of traders in Bishenyi unloading timber at night has continued. I had already reported this matter to Mr. Eugene, the representative of RRA Kamonyi, and we agreed to visit the site together tomorrow, Thursday, July 9, 2026, at 9 a.m. to meet with the timber traders and address this concern.&nbsp;</div><div>I would kindly request that Gloriose accompany us.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you.<!--EndFragment--> </div>', 'general', '5,4', NULL, 7, '2026-07-08 10:43:52', '2026-07-08 10:43:52', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(193, 'Request permission to go to the hospital.', 'Dear HR,&nbsp;&nbsp;<div>I would like to request permission to leave the office at 3:00 PM for an appointment with my eye doctor in town.&nbsp;&nbsp;</div><div>Thank you.&nbsp;&nbsp;<br></div>', 'permission', '1', NULL, 2, '2026-07-08 11:51:58', '2026-07-08 11:51:58', '2026-07-08 15:00:00', '2026-07-08 17:00:00', NULL, NULL),
(194, 'Leave of Rutayisire Hirwa', 'Dear Chantal,&nbsp;<div>This is to inform you that Rutayisire Hirwa will be in his annual leave from 14th July to 26th July 2026. Nyiraguhirwa Josiane is engaged to continue his responsabilities during that period.</div><div>Thank you for your consideration</div>', 'general', '73', NULL, 1, '2026-07-08 12:22:35', '2026-07-08 12:22:35', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(195, 'LETTER ASKING PAYMENT FOR SECURITY', '<div class=\"mb-4\"><p>Good morning, this attachment bellow is letter asking for payment of security at Bishenyi ICPC</p><div><br></div></div>', 'general', '3', NULL, 74, '2026-07-10 11:57:21', '2026-07-10 11:57:22', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/communications/1783677442_7c2fe1481a7c1019.pdf', ''),
(196, 'Assessment of Security Cameras and Printers', '<div>Dear ED.</div><div><!--StartFragment-->Good morning,&nbsp;</div><div>I wish to inform you that I will accompany Danny to obtain quotations for security cameras and small printers.&nbsp;</div><div>Our visit is necessary to physically assess the equipment in order to identify the options that will best meet our needs.<!--EndFragment--></div><div>Thanks.</div>', 'general', '5,4', NULL, 7, '2026-07-13 10:13:45', '2026-07-13 10:13:45', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(197, 'kumenyesha', 'Dear Muhirwa,<div><br></div><div>Ejo kuwa gatatu tariki ya 15.07.2026, uzatwara claudine kuri field hano muri kicukiro, witegure kare umugereho 8h30\'za mugitondo.</div><div>Urakoze cyane.</div>', 'general', '102', NULL, 7, '2026-07-14 16:23:29', '2026-07-14 16:23:29', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(198, 'To communicate', '<!--StartFragment--><p>Dear HR,</p><p>Claudine has requested a vehicle, as tomorrow she will be working in the field in Kicukiro. In case another staff member requires the vehicle, they are kindly asked to wait until she has completed her assignment.</p><p>Thank you very much.</p><p>Best regards,</p><p>&nbsp;Emmanuel B.</p><!--EndFragment-->', 'general', '1', NULL, 7, '2026-07-14 16:26:58', '2026-07-14 16:26:58', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(199, 'Gusaba uruhushya rwo kugucunga ibikoresho', 'HR,<div>Nejejwe no kubandikira mbasaba uruhushya mugitondo rwose kuba hafi y\'ibikoresho byo munzu yanjye mugihe baraba bari kuyisana. Ndasaba uruhushya rwa mbere ya saa siye.</div>', 'permission', '1', NULL, 2, '2026-07-21 00:27:58', '2026-07-21 00:27:58', '2026-07-21 09:00:00', '2026-07-21 12:00:00', NULL, NULL),
(200, 'Medical permission Request', '<!--StartFragment--><p><strong>Dear HR,</strong></p><p>I am pleased to write to request permission to attend medical treatment here in Gahanga. Once the treatment is completed, I will immediately return to work.</p><p>Thank you for your kind consideration.</p><!--EndFragment-->', 'permission', '1', NULL, 7, '2026-07-21 10:46:11', '2026-07-21 10:46:11', '2026-07-21 10:45:00', '2026-07-21 13:00:00', NULL, NULL),
(201, 'Asking permission', '<!--StartFragment--><p data-path-to-node=\"3\"><b>Dear Olga,</b></p><blockquote data-path-to-node=\"4\"><p data-path-to-node=\"4,0\">Hi&nbsp;</p><p data-path-to-node=\"4,1\">I am writing to request permission on Thursday to attend a medical appointment at the hospital.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"4,2\">I will keep you updated on my availability. I will ensure any urgent tasks are well hundred before I leave.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"4,3\">Thank you for understanding.</p><p data-path-to-node=\"4,4\">Best regards,</p></blockquote><!--EndFragment-->', 'general', '1', NULL, 73, '2026-07-21 17:27:35', '2026-07-21 17:27:35', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(202, 'To request again permission', '<strong>Dear HR,</strong>&nbsp;<div>&nbsp;As I had requested permission yesterday to seek medical treatment, I went and was given medication, but I have continued not to feel well. That is why I am writing again to kindly request permission to return to the hospital, as I am experiencing a back problem and cannot sit for long periods.</div><div>&nbsp;Thank you. </div>', 'permission', '1', '1', 7, '2026-07-22 09:32:34', '2026-07-22 15:55:15', '2026-07-22 09:31:00', '2026-07-22 17:00:00', NULL, NULL),
(203, 'To submit repo medical', '<p><strong>Dear HR,</strong></p><p> I hope this message finds you well.&nbsp;</p><p>As I had informed you earlier, I went for medical treatment. The doctors examined me and prescribed medication, but I have not yet fully recovered. Therefore, I am sending you this medical report because I am currently unable to sit for long periods, which is why they provided it to me so that I can first take the medication and see if my condition improves.</p><p>I sincerely appreciate your continued support in helping me recover.</p><div></div>', 'general', '1', NULL, 7, '2026-07-22 15:18:05', '2026-07-22 15:18:05', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/communications/1784726285_7bc4964f2b90b231.jpg', ''),
(204, 'Kumenyesha', '<!--StartFragment-->John mwiriwe neza, nagirango nkumenyeshe ko ejo ku itariki 29 Nyakanga 2026 Uzatwara Daniel na Gloriose kuri NIRDA mu nama bazitabira yo. Urahavugana na Gloriose isaha uzabagereraho kugirango batazakerererwa inama ya 9h30\' .Murakoze.<!--EndFragment-->', 'general', '103', NULL, 7, '2026-07-28 11:19:50', '2026-07-28 11:19:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(205, 'Update on ICPC Information', '<!--StartFragment--><p><strong>Dear Gloriose,</strong></p><p>I have gathered the information you requested regarding ICPC activities and payment methods:</p><ul role=\"list\"><li><p><strong>East:</strong> Mr. Jnavie, President of ICPC Rwamagana</p></li><li><p><strong>South:</strong> Mr. Dieudonné, ICPC Huye (President of RWVCA in Huye)</p></li><li><p><strong>West:</strong> Mr. Innocent Niyitegeka, ICPC Huye</p></li><li><p><strong>Kigali City:</strong> Mrs. Umutesi Ruth, President of&nbsp; Gasabo</p></li><li><p><strong>North:</strong> Mr. Deogratias President of Musanze (will prepare and share details later)</p></li></ul><p>I wanted to share with you the information collected so far. I will forward the North Province details once available.</p><!--EndFragment-->', 'general', '6', NULL, 7, '2026-07-28 11:46:00', '2026-07-28 11:46:00', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/communications/1785231960_79e0d6712f03c840.xlsx', ''),
(206, 'Sharing payment proof', '<!--StartFragment--><p><strong>Dear Claude,</strong></p><p>I am delighted to write to you to provide the payment for our new member who has purchased shares in <em>Amasezerano Community Bank</em>. His name is <strong>RWIRIRIZA Erneste</strong>, and he is engaged in the production of <strong>seedlings and tree nurseries</strong>.</p><p>Thank you.</p><!--EndFragment-->', 'general', '3', NULL, 7, '2026-07-28 14:10:38', '2026-07-28 14:10:38', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/communications/1785240638_ee76ab53f8048343.pdf', ''),
(207, 'Kumenyesha', '<b>Mwaramutse neza Logistic,</b><br>Nkuko byagaragaye ko internet dukoresha isigaye idakora neza tukaba twarasabwe kubere niba twahindura umu service provider, nimuri urwo rwego mukanya saa tanu hari aba tekinisiye bo muri KOPA TELECOM, baraza kudusura hano kuri office kugirango barebe aho dukorera muri gahunda ijyanye no kuba baduha internest service ndetse tukaba dukomeje no gushakisha n\'abandi ba service provider batandukanye.<br>Nibahagera ndaza kubamenyesha.<br><br>Murakoze.', 'general', '1,7', NULL, 2, '2026-08-05 10:17:44', '2026-08-05 10:17:44', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(208, 'GUSABA URUHUSHYA RWO KUNJYA GUTABARA', '<div>Mwaramutse Neza</div><div><br></div>Mbandikiye mbasaba uruhushya Ejo Tariki 12 Kanama SAA(11:00 AM) kugira ngo njye gushingura umubyeyi wacu watabarutse Mucyumweru Gishyize.&nbsp; &nbsp; <div><br></div><div>Murakoze</div>', 'general', '1', NULL, 101, '2026-08-11 09:18:35', '2026-08-11 09:18:35', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(209, 'BURIAL OF MY GRAND FATHER', 'Dear Olga,<div><br></div><div>Mbandikiye mbasaba uruhushya rwokujya gushyingura sogokuru wange waraye witabye Imana irijoro, akaba azashyingurwa kumunsi wejo i Rusizi.</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div>Murakoze.</div>', 'permission', '1', NULL, 75, '2026-08-11 09:29:15', '2026-08-11 09:29:15', '2026-08-12 09:28:00', '2026-08-12 09:28:00', NULL, NULL),
(210, 'FIELD VISIT', '<div>Hello,</div><!--StartFragment-->Good morning.&nbsp;<div>Yesterday, I spoke with&nbsp; Mr. Martin, an employee of RRA Gasabo. He assigned me one of their staff who will accompany us to the field. We go to visit timber traders operating in Kabuga Centre, Zindiro, and Mushimire site. Our objective is to follow up and gain a clear understanding of how they manage to purchase timber at low prices than the operators working in ICPCs. We also intend to search informal persons who can provide us with information regarding the vehicles transporting timber to these sites. I will be accompanied by Claudine. Thank you.<!--EndFragment--> </div>', 'general', '5,4', NULL, 7, '2026-08-11 09:49:02', '2026-08-11 09:49:02', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(211, 'Kugirwa inama', 'Dear Manzi,<div>Nshingiye kuri raporo yawe y\'umunsi w\'itariki ya 10.08.2026 aho wagaragajeko imbaho mwakiriye 300 zizasorerwa ku itariki ya 13.08.2026.</div><div>Ndagirango ngusabe kwirinda amakosa nkaya, uwaranguye imbaho aba agomba no kuzisorera, ntabwo wemerewe gukopa umusoro wa Leta, ndetse no kugirana amasezerano n\'umucuruzi nkuko wabimbwiye. Wishyuze uyu muntu kandi ntibizongere ukundi.</div><div><br></div><div>Urakoze.</div>', 'general', '113,73', NULL, 7, '2026-08-11 09:55:51', '2026-08-11 09:55:51', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(212, 'GUSABA URUHUSHYA RWO KUNJYA GUSHYINGURA', '<!--StartFragment-->Mwiriwe<br><br>Mbandikiye mbasaba uruhushya Ejo Tariki 12 Kanama SAA(10:00 AM kugeza SAA 17:00) kugira ngo njye gushingura umubyeyi wacu watabarutse.&nbsp; &nbsp;<div><br></div><div>Murakoze</div><!--EndFragment-->', 'permission', '1', NULL, 101, '2026-08-11 16:10:04', '2026-08-11 16:10:04', '2026-08-12 22:00:00', '2026-08-12 17:00:00', NULL, NULL),
(213, 'Kwibutsa', 'Mwaramutse neza bagenzi bange?<div><br></div><div>Ndagirango mbibutse ko raporo y\'umunsi igomba kurara muri portal system no muri quickbook.&nbsp;</div><div>Abatabigenza uko raporo zabo zifatwa nkizitatanzwe.&nbsp;</div><div>Utaramenya uko ashyira raporo muri portal ahamagare Daniel amufashe. Hanyuma byose bikomeze kugenda neza.&nbsp;</div><div>Murakoze.</div>', 'general', '105,80,116,74,78,76,113,79,106,73,101,75,107,71,112,110,72,108,77,81,109,82', '116,72,74', 7, '2026-08-12 11:00:11', '2026-08-15 19:11:50', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(214, 'Request for permission', '<!--StartFragment--><p class=\"isselectedend\"><span style=\"color:#212529\">Dear ED, I would like to request permission to attend a medical consultation from 1:30pm to 3:30pm.&nbsp;</span>Thank you for your consideration.</p><!--EndFragment-->', 'permission', '5', NULL, 1, '2026-08-14 12:46:09', '2026-08-14 12:46:09', '2026-08-14 13:30:00', '2026-08-14 15:30:00', NULL, NULL),
(215, 'REFUND request', 'Muraho,<div><br></div><div>Hari umu client witwa BUSHAKEBWIMA Elie yaranguye imbaho mukorera facture&nbsp;</div><div>Bageze hagati imbaho basanga nimbi biba ngombwa ko bazisubizamo.&nbsp;</div><div>Madrien 680</div>', 'general', '3', NULL, 77, '2026-08-22 09:29:38', '2026-08-22 09:29:38', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL),
(216, 'REFUND', 'Refund yakozwe', 'general', '3', NULL, 77, '2026-08-22 09:36:51', '2026-08-22 09:36:51', NULL, NULL, 'uploads/communications/1787384211_519ad0f7300879e7.jpg', ''),
(217, 'Kumenyesha Impamvu twakoze refund', 'Uyu munsi harumuclient witwa Eucalyptus ltd yazanye imbaho za pinus 220 ari gupakurura ageze hagati amaze gukuramo imbaho nkeya abona nimbi azisubizamo kandi yari yishyuye kuri momo amafranga anagana na 279475 twemeranya ko nazana izindi mbaho tuzayaherayo kuko izi mbaho yazanze bazisubiza mumodoka.', 'general', '3', NULL, 74, '2026-08-22 12:49:41', '2026-08-22 12:49:41', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
