t; font-family:\"Calibri\",sans-serif; mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family:\"Times New Roman\"; mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;} </style> <![endif]--> <!--StartFragment--> <p class=\"isselectedend\" style=\"margin:0cm\">Dear Kwihangana, Following our discussion last week, you are kindly invited to a meeting with the HR Office to discuss and align on a few matters aimed at further improving your work and performance.</p> <p class=\"isselectedend\" style=\"margin:0cm\">The meeting is scheduled for <strong><span style=\"font-weight:normal\">Tuesday, 25 August 2026, at 2:00 p.m.</span></strong> at the RWVCA office.<o:p></o:p></p> <p class=\"isselectedend\" style=\"margin:0cm\">We look forward to meeting with you. Best regards,&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"font-weight:normal\">HR.</span></strong></p> <!--EndFragment-->', 'general', '78', NULL, 1, '2026-08-24 09:06:28', '2026-08-24 09:06:28', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL);
