(4, 13, 5, 'Hello Gogo, Mushyireho Chairman kuko niwe wayoboye inama ntabwo arijye. Hanyuma ubutaha any activity mujye mumenya neza niba iri muri concept note cg yakorewe MeMo.\r\nThanks!', '2026-02-13 13:02:53', '2026-02-13 13:02:53', NULL, 'active'),
