(40, 93, 1, 'Uraho neza Alphonse. Tubabajwe no kumenya ko urwaye kandi turakwihanganishije! Ni byiza ko wabonanye na muganga. Kugira ngo uru ruhushya rwemezwe hashingiwe ku mategeko agenga umurimo, urasabwa kutugezaho icyemezo cya muganga (Repos Medical) cyerekana iminsi y\'ikiruhuko yakugeneye n\'igihe uzagarukira mu kazi.\r\nTurakwifuriza gukira vuba.\r\nMurakoze.\"', '2026-04-08 07:26:27', '2026-04-08 07:26:27', NULL, 'active'),
(41, 95, 1, 'Ok. noted', '2026-04-08 15:00:24', '2026-04-08 15:00:24', NULL, 'active'),
(42, 96, 1, 'Approved', '2026-04-09 09:59:30', '2026-04-09 09:59:30', NULL, 'active'),
(43, 98, 2, 'Noted with thanks!', '2026-04-10 15:32:54', '2026-04-10 15:32:54', NULL, 'active'),
(44, 98, 105, 'RECEIVED SIR,THANKS', '2026-04-13 05:03:41', '2026-04-13 05:03:41', NULL, 'active'),
(45, 99, 5, 'Mwaramutse neza, Mwihangane kdi mukomere.\r\nHanyuma mwakora declararation, RIB ikabaha icyangobwa ubundi mugafashwa.\r\n\r\nUmunsi mwiza!', '2026-04-13 07:57:55', '2026-04-13 07:57:55', NULL, 'active'),
(46, 102, 5, 'Thank you for the update. \r\nPlease ensure we receive all required forms as soon as possible so we can submit them to MINEDUC no later than this week.\r\nBest regards,\r\nED', '2026-04-13 13:36:56', '2026-04-13 13:36:56', NULL, 'active'),
(47, 108, 5, 'Urakoze cyane kumenyasha Emmamuel, ntacyo ukomeze ubikurikirane tuze kumenya uko byarangiye.\r\nSawa.', '2026-04-14 11:41:21', '2026-04-14 11:41:21', NULL, 'active'),
(48, 109, 7, 'Josiane uze kumpa telephone zabo niba uzifite cyangwa umpe amazina yabo mvugane na Perezida twumve impamvu badashaka gusora.', '2026-04-14 13:17:46', '2026-04-14 13:17:46', NULL, 'active'),
(49, 109, 7, 'Dear Josiane, Alexis na Mukecuru wambwiye ko bapakuruye nijoro ku itariki 7 Mata 2026; bampakaniye ariko mbumvisha ko ibyo bakoze binyuranije n\'amategeko ndetse n\'amabwiriza y\'Agakiriro. Alexis yaje kunyemerera ko agiye kwisubiraho nubwo mbere yari yabanje kumpakanira. Na mukecuru yambwiye ko adapakurura nijoro kuko ngo burigihe arakubwira. Dukomeze guhanahana amakuru bizajya bigenda bicogora.', '2026-04-16 14:55:51', '2026-04-16 14:55:51', NULL, 'active'),
(50, 117, 1, 'Dear Dany, \r\nPlease be reminded that this afternoon we have a Commemoration of the Genocide taking place at PSF, and it is mandatory for all staff to attend. Consequently, you will need to postpone your meeting with the external developers to another day next week.\r\nThank you for your understanding. \r\nBest regards,\r\nHR', '2026-04-17 07:50:54', '2026-04-17 07:50:54', NULL, 'active'),
(51, 117, 2, 'Since they’re unavailable, they scheduled this for Friday afternoon. These features are essential, and that’s the only time they’ve given me flexibility. Because they’re consultants and arranging a physical meeting with them can be tricky, it sometimes becomes challenging.', '2026-04-17 08:02:07', '2026-04-17 08:02:07', NULL, 'active'),
(52, 125, 1, 'Approved', '2026-04-29 07:59:56', '2026-04-29 07:59:56', NULL, 'active'),
(53, 126, 7, 'Dear Olga,\r\n\r\nNow, Muhirwa will be driving the leaders to Rwamagana, the vehicle may not be available today.', '2026-04-30 10:17:37', '2026-04-30 10:17:37', NULL, 'active'),
(54, 131, 1, 'Yego, mwajya kugikemura mukubahiriza ayo masaha!', '2026-05-04 07:54:49', '2026-05-04 07:54:49', NULL, 'active'),
(55, 129, 1, 'Dear Moses, \r\nKindly complete the leave request form for the day off you intend to take. \r\nThanks', '2026-05-04 08:01:18', '2026-05-04 08:01:18', NULL, 'active'),
(56, 135, 7, 'Verified. Mwajyana na Olga agiye kurukiko.', '2026-05-08 12:58:56', '2026-05-08 12:58:56', NULL, 'active'),
(57, 139, 1, 'ok. noted', '2026-05-13 11:04:11', '2026-05-13 11:04:11', NULL, 'active'),
(58, 140, 1, 'Twishimiye ayo makuru meza ko wabyaye, kandi tuguhaye impundu. \r\nUmukozi w\'umugabo wabyaye hari icyo itegeko ry\'umurimo rimuteganyiriza kugirango ashobore kwita k\' umugore we n\'umwana twagusabaga ko waduha icyemezo cyuko mwasezeranye hamwe n\'icyemezo cy\'ivuka ry\'umwana kugirango uhabwe ibiteganywa n\'amategeko.', '2026-05-14 08:27:45', '2026-05-14 08:27:45', NULL, 'active'),
(59, 140, 1, 'Twishimiye ayo makuru meza ko wabyaye, kandi tuguhaye impundu. \r\nUmukozi w\'umugabo wabyaye hari icyo itegeko ry\'umurimo rimuteganyiriza kugirango ashobore kwita k\' umugore we n\'umwana twagusabaga ko waduha icyemezo cyuko mwasezeranye hamwe n\'icyemezo cy\'ivuka ry\'umwana kugirango uhabwe ibiteganywa n\'amategeko.', '2026-05-14 08:27:53', '2026-05-14 08:27:53', NULL, 'active'),
(60, 142, 5, 'Good morning, dear Olga.\r\n The permission is approved, and I extend my deepest condolences to the family for the loss of their child.\r\nMay our Almighty God bring comfort and strength to the family in this painful time. \r\nStay strong!', '2026-05-18 08:21:08', '2026-05-18 08:21:08', NULL, 'active'),
(61, 145, 7, 'Dear Josiane. Twabivuganyeho na Claudine ko wazifata ahongaho noneho zikishyurwa hakoreshejwe pettit cash. Kuko bihendutse kurusha kuba twazohereza zivuye hano kukazi. Murakoze.', '2026-05-20 13:13:09', '2026-05-20 13:13:09', NULL, 'active'),
(62, 147, 3, 'Wiriwe neza,\r\nNagusabye ifoto ya registre ntabwo ari igitabo cyandikwamo suppliers\r\n\r\nMerçi!', '2026-05-21 14:49:47', '2026-05-21 14:49:47', NULL, 'active'),
(63, 147, 108, 'Mwangeye kwirirwa \r\nrekanze mbikoreho nabyo', '2026-05-21 16:38:38', '2026-05-21 16:38:38', NULL, 'active'),
(64, 149, 3, 'Received !', '2026-05-22 07:38:55', '2026-05-22 07:38:55', NULL, 'active'),
(65, 149, 108, 'thank you', '2026-05-22 11:19:53', '2026-05-22 11:19:53', NULL, 'active'),
(66, 150, 7, 'Urakoze cyane Odille, Umwuzurize registration form hanyuma unashyireho icyiciro cy\'umusanzu azajya atanga nkuko yari yatubwiye ko yajya mucya 300k ubwo wabishyiraho noneho akanaduha RDB certificate ye.', '2026-05-28 09:54:03', '2026-05-28 09:54:03', NULL, 'active'),
(67, 151, 7, 'Mwiriwe neza Anastase, Urabwira Daniel ikibazo machine ifite nawe arakubwira icyo gukora nyuma yo kumva ikibazo. Ndabibutsa ko ibikoresho by\'ikigo bigomba gufatwa neza n\'ubikoresha kandi akaba ari nawe responsable w\'ikibazo byagira.', '2026-05-29 07:02:11', '2026-05-29 07:02:11', NULL, 'active'),
(68, 153, 4, 'Received ! proceed', '2026-05-29 09:16:41', '2026-05-29 09:16:41', NULL, 'active'),
(69, 152, 2, 'Mwiriwe neza,\r\nNdizera mu meze neza, \r\nYego ikibazo cye yarakimbwiye ndetse mubwirako iyo igikoresho kigize ikibazo biri mu nshingano y\'ufite icyo gikoresho kubijyanye no kugikoresha. Yambwiyeko ifite ikibazo cya keyboard, mubaza niba ntakintu cyamenetsemo ariko aramakanira ambwirako byizanye. \r\nNkuko mwabimubwiye ko ariwe ugomba gukoresha igikoresho nkuko biri mu mabwiriza bahabwa mbere yo gutwara igikoresho, ndumva twamuhuza na supplier akamuhuza n\'umu technician.\r\nMurakoze', '2026-05-29 12:52:08', '2026-05-29 12:52:08', NULL, 'active'),
(70, 128, 110, 'MWARAMUTSE NEZA,YARABIHINDUYE NGO AZABANZA MW\'IJANA N\'IBYANGOMBWA  BYE BYOSE BIRI MURI FILE NABAHAYE.MURAKOZE', '2026-06-01 08:10:57', '2026-06-01 08:10:57', NULL, 'active'),
(71, 152, 7, 'Okay, niba assessment wakoze warasanze ikibazo cyayo kigomba kujya muba Technician kandi ariwe uyijyanye wamuhuza na Grace akaba yamurangira ahantu hizewe yayikoreshereza cg nawe nkumuntu umenyereye ibikoresho bya electronic wamufasha mugihe ikibazo kitaba kireba supplier.', '2026-06-01 14:47:19', '2026-06-01 14:47:19', NULL, 'active'),
(72, 154, 1, 'Dear Daniel, ntabwo request yawe nahise nyibona mwasabye uruhushya twatashye, kandi pole kuba utameze neza, mushobora kujya kwivuza ikigoroba? cyangwa mukaba mwabikora ejo?', '2026-06-02 07:58:18', '2026-06-02 07:58:18', NULL, 'active'),
(73, 154, 2, 'Murakoze cyane, \r\nntakibazo nazakujyayo ejo kuwa 3 tariki 03/06/2026', '2026-06-02 10:21:51', '2026-06-02 10:21:51', NULL, 'active'),
(74, 152, 2, 'Okay,\r\nNdaza ku mubaza niba aho aherereye hari aba tekenisiye cyangwa see niba byamushobokera ko yayikoreshereza ikigali kuko umu supplier we icyo yadufasha nukuduhuza nuwadukorera, kuko muri guarantee harimo soft issues not hardware.', '2026-06-02 14:51:30', '2026-06-02 14:51:30', NULL, 'active'),
(75, 154, 2, 'Mwaramutse neza HR,\r\n\r\nNtago nabashije kujya kwivuza nkuko byari biteganyijwe ko uyu munsi njyayo, kuko umuganga wari kumfasha bambwiyeko aboneka kuwa 2, ubwo nasabyeko rendezvous bayimurira kuwa 2 icyumweru gitaha (09/06/2026) ko aribwo umuganga wari kumfasha azaboneka.\r\n\r\nNimuri urwo rwego nasabaga uruhushya kuri iyo tariki (09.06.2026 kuwa 2) ry\'umunsi wose kandi bisaba kuzinduka kuko nzajya kwivuriza Bishenyi-Kamonyi.\r\n\r\nMurakoze mugire umunsi mwiza', '2026-06-03 08:01:16', '2026-06-03 08:01:16', 73, 'active'),
(76, 154, 1, 'Ok, ntakibazo', '2026-06-03 11:47:04', '2026-06-03 11:47:04', 75, 'active'),
(77, 157, 1, 'Dear Emmanuel,\r\nThank you for informing us about your condition and I am sorry to hear that. Please go to the hospital and get the medical care you need. Wishing you a quick and full recovery.', '2026-06-05 07:41:05', '2026-06-05 07:41:05', NULL, 'active'),
(78, 160, 5, 'Permission allowed', '2026-06-09 13:41:02', '2026-06-09 13:41:02', NULL, 'active'),
(79, 164, 7, 'Okay. Ubwo niwowe uyishinzwe kuva sasaba kugeza igarutse kukazi.', '2026-06-10 11:08:25', '2026-06-10 11:08:25', NULL, 'active'),
(80, 162, 1, 'Approved. Thank you', '2026-06-10 12:35:40', '2026-06-10 12:35:40', NULL, 'active'),
(81, 165, 7, 'Okay.', '2026-06-11 10:08:50', '2026-06-11 10:08:50', NULL, 'active'),
(82, 169, 1, 'Dear Moses,\r\nThank you for informing us. Your request is well noted. We wish you a speedy recovery and hope you regain your health soon,  and we look forward to welcoming you back after your medical leave. Take care and get well soon.\r\nBest regards, HR', '2026-06-16 08:25:04', '2026-06-16 08:25:04', NULL, 'active'),
(83, 167, 1, 'well received. thanks', '2026-06-16 08:25:42', '2026-06-16 08:25:42', NULL, 'active'),
(84, 176, 3, 'Ok', '2026-06-21 17:25:26', '2026-06-21 17:25:26', NULL, 'active'),
(85, 177, 1, 'permission approved', '2026-06-22 13:32:47', '2026-06-22 13:32:47', NULL, 'active'),
(86, 178, 7, 'Okay. Ubwo muragenda na Muhirwa.', '2026-06-23 07:59:43', '2026-06-23 07:59:43', NULL, 'active'),
(87, 180, 5, 'Yooo, sorry wagenda ntakibazo', '2026-06-24 13:55:43', '2026-06-24 13:55:43', NULL, 'active'),
(88, 182, 1, 'Dear Josiane,\r\nI have received your request. When you have some free time and are not occupied with your daily duties, please come to RWVCA Head office so that we can discuss it further.\r\nThank you, and I look forward to seeing you.\r\nHR', '2026-07-02 09:42:19', '2026-07-02 09:42:19', NULL, 'active'),
(89, 184, 1, 'ok. approved', '2026-07-02 14:25:10', '2026-07-02 14:25:10', NULL, 'active'),
(90, 181, 7, 'Josiane mwiriwe neza?\r\nIki kibazo nakiganiriyeho na Accountant wa cooperative hamwe na Felecien, bambwiyeko giterwa n\'abayobozi badashyira mubikorwa ingamba zafashwe, nkuko babyiyemeje ko agakiriro gafungura 6h00 kagafunga 18h30\'z\'umugoroba ariko bamwe mubayobozi nibo bica iyi gahunda.Bambwiyeko bari munzira zo guhindura ubwo buyobozi ariko ndaza kongera mvugane na rra tuzashake uko tuhagera vuba cyane.', '2026-07-02 15:06:16', '2026-07-02 15:06:16', NULL, 'active'),
(91, 181, 74, 'Thank you', '2026-07-02 17:08:57', '2026-07-02 17:08:57', 90, 'active'),
(92, 182, 74, 'Good afternoon, tomorrow I will come there at 3pm\r\nThank you', '2026-07-02 18:03:19', '2026-07-02 18:03:19', 88, 'active'),
