INSERT INTO `events` (`id`, `title`, `description`, `status`, `date`, `created_at`, `updated_at`, `image`) VALUES
(23, '400 Skilled Carpenters Earn National Certification Through the Recognition of Prior Learning (RPL) Program', '<p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; transition: 0.3s; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16.8px; white-space-collapse: collapse;\">In a remarkable milestone for Rwanda’s skills development agenda, 400 skilled carpenters have officially earned their National Certification through the Recognition of Prior Learning (<strong>RPL</strong>) program. This achievement was made possible through strong collaboration among Rwanda Wood Value Chain Association (<strong>RWVCA</strong>), Rwanda TVET Board (<strong>RTB</strong>), and the Skills Development Fund (<strong>SDF</strong>).</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; transition: 0.3s; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16.8px; white-space-collapse: collapse;\">The certification ceremony, held on&nbsp;<strong>October 31, 2025</strong>, marked the culmination of months of assessment and validation, recognizing the experience, talent, and dedication of carpenters who have long contributed to Rwanda’s construction and woodwork industry.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; transition: 0.3s; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16.8px; white-space-collapse: collapse;\">The <strong>RPL</strong> program provides an opportunity for skilled workers, many of whom acquired their expertise through hands-on experience rather than formal training, to have their competencies officially recognized in line with national standards.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; transition: 0.3s; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16.8px; white-space-collapse: collapse;\">By earning certification, these carpenters now gain access to broader employment opportunities, professional credibility, and potential pathways for further technical advancement.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; transition: 0.3s; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16.8px; white-space-collapse: collapse;\">This collaboration with RTB and the Skills Development Fund continues to demonstrate our shared commitment to upskilling Rwanda’s workforce and promoting sustainable livelihoods through technical and vocational excellence.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; transition: 0.3s; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16.8px; white-space-collapse: collapse;\">As we celebrate this achievement, we remain dedicated to expanding similar opportunities to other sectors and skilled professionals across the country.</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; transition: 0.3s; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16.8px; white-space-collapse: collapse;\">________________________________________________________________________</p><p style=\"margin-bottom: 1rem; transition: 0.3s; font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Noto Sans&quot;, &quot;Liberation Sans&quot;, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Noto Color Emoji&quot;; font-size: 16.8px; white-space-collapse: collapse;\">See more&nbsp;<a href=\"https://pixies.et/xBgIP6Zx\" target=\"_blank\">https://pixies.et/xBgIP6Zx</a></p>', 'published', '2025-10-31', '2025-11-12 08:20:56', '2025-11-12 08:21:04', 'uploads/events/event_1762935656.jpeg');
