(4, 4, 'pending', 75, 'Leave request submitted by employee', '2026-03-04 12:39:39'),
(5, 2, 'reverted', 1, 'Dear Solange,\\r\\nWe have received your leave form. However, we still require a formal letter addressed to the Executive Director to process your request. Please submit this letter at your earliest convenience so we can proceed.\\r\\nThank you,', '2026-03-05 07:36:16'),
(6, 5, 'pending', 105, 'Leave request submitted by employee', '2026-03-05 17:21:57'),
(7, 6, 'pending', 105, 'Leave request submitted by employee', '2026-03-05 17:23:13'),
(8, 7, 'pending', 77, 'Leave request submitted by employee', '2026-03-06 14:27:31'),
(9, 7, 'verified_by_hr', 1, '', '2026-03-09 07:10:55'),
(10, 7, 'reverted', 1, 'Dear Solange, could you please update your leave request? The reason should be Annual Leave, and the entitlement year should be 2025. Since you still have 11 days pending from 2025, must used first. Thank you for your consideration. Best regards, HR', '2026-03-09 07:29:00'),
(11, 4, 'reverted', 1, 'Dear Alphonse, we have reviewed your leave request and we would like to ask if you could consider adjusting your dates. During that period, Umutoni will be stationed at the Bishenyi site to cover Solange’s maternity leave. To ensure continuity of service at the Gisozi site, it would be ideal if you could take your leave after Solange returns. If these dates are fixed for you and cannot be changed, please let us know so that management can review the request further', '2026-03-09 08:02:13'),
(12, 1, 'reverted', 1, 'Dear Chantal, regarding this your recent submission, your leave request has not been considered or approved. The request was sent after office hours, and per association policy, annual leave must be requested two weeks in advance. Furthermore, short-notice leave still requires a reasonable lead time to ensure site operations continue smoothly. Please ensure future requests follow these guidelines. Thank you for your consideration.', '2026-03-09 08:12:49'),
