(5279, 1, 'mission_request', 'New Mission Request #3', 'Employee <strong>NYIRABAHIZI Gloriose</strong> submitted mission request <strong>#3</strong><br>\r\n                                            <strong>Destination:</strong> Rwamagana - Nyanza - Kigali - Rwamagana<br>\r\n                                            <strong>Purpose:</strong> Dear HR,&nbsp;<div><br></div><div>I kindly request a mission order to participate in the study tour organized by ICRAF, on 11 June 2026. The study tour aims to introduce and connect PFMUs Cooperatives with Ultimate Forest Company for market linkage.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div>Route: Rwamagana - Nyanza - Kigali - Rwamagana.</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you for your consideration.&nbsp;</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><br>\r\n                                            <strong>Period:</strong> 2026-06-11 → 2026-06-11 (1 days)', 'read', '2026-06-10 09:27:01', '2026-06-10 13:02:11', NULL, 'https://rwvca.org.rw/dashboard1/mission_request_details.php?id=3'),
