(292, 'Incident Report & Recommendation – EBM Tablet Issue (Odile – Gatsibo Zone)', 'Incident', '<p>Dear Emmy,\r\n\r\n<strong>RE: Odile’s EBM Tablet – Recurring Malfunction &amp; Recommendation for Replacement\r\n</strong></p><p>I am writing to report an ongoing technical issue affecting Odile, our staff member based in Gatsibo Zone, regarding her tablet used for the EBM system.\r\n\r\n</p><p><strong>Incident Summary</strong></p><p>Odile’s tablet has not been working well for several days. She first came to us for support. We attempted to fix the issue, and the tablet worked for about one day, but then failed again.</p><p>She later visited RRA for more advanced technical support. RRA tried to assist her, but the same issue recurred. Upon her return, RRA informed her that they had done everything possible and formally suggested replacing the tablet with a new one running a recent or near‑updated Android version.\r\n\r\n</p><p><strong>Risk Identified</strong></p><p>Given the repeated failures, even after both our internal attempts and RRA’s intervention, continuing to use the current tablet may result in the&nbsp;<strong>loss of EBM files and important data</strong>. The device is no longer reliable for daily operations.\r\n\r\n</p><p><strong>Final Recommendation</strong></p><p>I recommend approving the replacement of Odile’s tablet with a newer, compatible device (a recent Android version), as advised by RRA. This will:</p><ul><li>Prevent further disruption of her work in Gatsibo Zone.</li><li>Avoid potential loss of EBM data.</li><li>Provide a long‑term solution instead of temporary fixes.\r\n\r\n</li></ul><p>Please let me know if you need any further information.</p><p>Best regards,</p>', '2026-04-10', '2026-04-10', 2, '2026-04-10 15:29:11', '2026-04-10 15:29:11', '09:00:00', '17:00:00', 'RWVCA Head Office'),
(293, 'DIARY REPORT', 'Activity', '<p>Dear Chantal,</p><p>Hello!</p><p><br></p><p>Herewith attached DIARY REPORT on 10/04/2026,</p><p><br></p><p>Best regards,</p><p><br></p><p>Balaka</p><p><br></p><p>Membership relations officer,</p><p><br></p><p>SDC RUBAVU</p>', '2026-04-10', '2026-04-10', 82, '2026-04-10 16:03:15', '2026-04-10 16:03:15', NULL, NULL, ''),
