(383, 'Field visit report', 'Travel', '<p>Dea ED,</p><p>I am pleased to present to you the report showing how the activity we undertook in Nyagatare District on April 17, 2026, went. In general, the activity well done and as we had planned. Today, the first trader will purchase timbers from Uganda, and it is also the day we expect to see the good results of the work accomplished.</p><p><br></p><p>Thanks.</p>', '2026-04-17', '2026-04-17', 7, '2026-04-20 07:29:31', '2026-04-20 07:29:31', NULL, NULL, ''),
