(391, 'field visit report', 'Travel', '<p><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(33, 37, 41);\">Dea HR,</span></p><p>I am pleased to share with you the report showing how the activity we have went in Nyagatare District on April 17, 2026, went. In general, the activity well done and as we had planned. Today, the first trader will purchase timbers from Uganda, and it is also the day we expect to see feedback of the work accomplished.</p><p><br></p><p>Thanks.</p>', '2026-04-17', '2026-04-17', 7, '2026-04-20 10:34:35', '2026-04-20 10:34:35', NULL, NULL, ''),
