(759, 'Recommended Windows Tablet and Bluetooth Printer Specifications for System and QuickBooks Use', 'Activity', '<!--StartFragment--><p data-start=\"79\" data-end=\"185\">Dear Logistic (Emmy),</p> <p data-start=\"209\" data-end=\"244\">I hope this message finds you well.</p> <p data-start=\"246\" data-end=\"475\">Following your request to identify a suitable Windows tablet that can run our system as well as QuickBooks without performance or compatibility issues, I have reviewed and prepared a recommended solution with full specifications.</p> <hr data-start=\"477\" data-end=\"480\"> <h2 data-section-id=\"mqq1bu\" data-start=\"482\" data-end=\"514\">1. Recommended Windows Tablet</h2> <p data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"579\"><strong data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"527\">Device:</strong> Microsoft Surface Go 3 LTE (Business Configuration)</p> <p data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"600\"><strong data-start=\"581\" data-end=\"600\">Specifications:</strong></p> <ul data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"1029\"> <li data-section-id=\"1n8jrd\" data-start=\"601\" data-end=\"644\"> Operating System: Windows 11 Pro (64-bit) </li> <li data-section-id=\"3hmatn\" data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"689\"> Processor: Intel Core i3-10100Y (10th Gen) </li> <li data-section-id=\"1z101m4\" data-start=\"690\" data-end=\"707\"> RAM: 8GB LPDDR3 </li> <li data-section-id=\"15qy5pz\" data-start=\"708\" data-end=\"759\"> Storage: 128GB SSD (256GB preferred if available) </li> <li data-section-id=\"1rva4iz\" data-start=\"760\" data-end=\"817\"> Display: 10.5-inch PixelSense touchscreen (1920 × 1280) </li> <li data-section-id=\"1yed18n\" data-start=\"818\" data-end=\"878\"> Connectivity: 4G LTE Advanced with Nano-SIM support + eSIM </li> <li data-section-id=\"l1ca4p\" data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"913\"> Wireless: Wi-Fi 6, Bluetooth 5.0 </li> <li data-section-id=\"18f6vny\" data-start=\"914\" data-end=\"961\"> Ports: USB-C, Surface Connect, headphone jack </li> <li data-section-id=\"186k0vh\" data-start=\"962\" data-end=\"994\"> Expansion: microSDXC card slot </li> <li data-section-id=\"13oaio5\" data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1029\"> Battery: Up to 10–11 hours usage </li> </ul> <p data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1050\"><strong data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1050\">Important Note:</strong></p> <ul data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1205\"> <li data-section-id=\"10f1cqm\" data-start=\"1051\" data-end=\"1140\"> The SIM functionality on this device is <strong data-start=\"1093\" data-end=\"1139\">for internet access and SMS receiving only</strong>. </li> <li data-section-id=\"1ozqz8q\" data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1205\"> It is <strong data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1204\">not used for normal voice calls like a mobile phone</strong>. </li> </ul> <p data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1225\"><strong data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1225\">Key Advantage:</strong></p> <ul data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1412\"> <li data-section-id=\"mtq4te\" data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1310\"> Fully supports Windows-based systems including QuickBooks and our internal system. </li> <li data-section-id=\"1cnqxf4\" data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1359\"> Portable for both field and office operations. </li> <li data-section-id=\"xyk22y\" data-start=\"1360\" data-end=\"1412\"> Enables mobile internet access via SIM card (LTE). </li> </ul> <hr data-start=\"1414\" data-end=\"1417\"> <h2 data-section-id=\"1cyfem3\" data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1469\">2. Recommended Printer for Field and Office Use</h2> <p data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1526\"><strong data-start=\"1471\" data-end=\"1482\">Device:</strong> OCOM 58mm Bluetooth Thermal Receipt Printer</p> <p data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1547\"><strong data-start=\"1528\" data-end=\"1547\">Specifications:</strong></p> <ul data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1810\"> <li data-section-id=\"17pxzpn\" data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1596\"> Printing Technology: Thermal (no ink required) </li> <li data-section-id=\"x1fxmu\" data-start=\"1597\" data-end=\"1629\"> Paper Size: 58mm receipt paper </li> <li data-section-id=\"1ly2re6\" data-start=\"1630\" data-end=\"1661\"> Connectivity: Bluetooth + USB </li> <li data-section-id=\"zwvzw6\" data-start=\"1662\" data-end=\"1706\"> Power: Rechargeable battery (portable use) </li> <li data-section-id=\"19k2ssy\" data-start=\"1707\" data-end=\"1747\"> Compatibility: Windows 10 / Windows 11 </li> <li data-section-id=\"1nuk3s9\" data-start=\"1748\" data-end=\"1810\"> Use Case: Receipts, invoices, and small transaction printing </li> </ul> <p data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1830\"><strong data-start=\"1812\" data-end=\"1830\">Key Advantage:</strong></p> <ul data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1962\"> <li data-section-id=\"1hnfqlx\" data-start=\"1831\" data-end=\"1864\"> Lightweight and highly portable </li> <li data-section-id=\"y1bncg\" data-start=\"1865\" data-end=\"1912\"> Low operating cost (no ink or toner required) </li> <li data-section-id=\"yi74zb\" data-start=\"1913\" data-end=\"1962\"> Easy Bluetooth connection with Surface Go 3 LTE </li> </ul> <hr data-start=\"1964\" data-end=\"1967\"> <h2 data-section-id=\"10jidtp\" data-start=\"1969\" data-end=\"1997\">3. Summary Recommendation</h2> <p data-start=\"1999\" data-end=\"2061\">This combination provides a complete mobile business solution:</p> <ul data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2302\"> <li data-section-id=\"a4sp3m\" data-start=\"2062\" data-end=\"2136\"> Windows tablet ensures full compatibility with our system and QuickBooks </li> <li data-section-id=\"b2rvig\" data-start=\"2137\" data-end=\"2223\"> LTE SIM support is used for internet access and SMS reception only (not voice calls) </li> <li data-section-id=\"1jl008a\" data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2302\"> Bluetooth thermal printer enables fast and portable receipt/invoice printing </li> </ul> <hr data-start=\"2304\" data-end=\"2307\"> <p data-start=\"2309\" data-end=\"2409\">Kind regards,</p><!--EndFragment-->', NULL, NULL, 2, '2026-06-16 15:19:41', '2026-06-16 15:19:41', NULL, NULL, ''),
(760, 'Follow-up: Light Issue in Project Coordination Office', 'Incident', '<!--StartFragment--><p data-start=\"68\" data-end=\"101\"><b>Dear Logistic</b>,</p><p data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"123\">I hope you are well.</p><p data-start=\"125\" data-end=\"323\">As I reported this issue before, I would like to follow up that the light in the Project Coordination Office is still not working. The office remains dark, which is affecting normal work activities.</p><p data-start=\"325\" data-end=\"433\">Kindly request your support to fix it as soon as possible so that we can work properly in a well-lit office.</p><p data-start=\"435\" data-end=\"465\">Thank you for your assistance.</p><p data-start=\"103\" data-end=\"123\"><!--StartFragment--> <!--EndFragment--></p><p data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"494\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Kind regards,</p><!--EndFragment-->', NULL, NULL, 2, '2026-06-16 15:44:39', '2026-06-16 15:44:39', NULL, NULL, ''),
