(766, 'RUSIZI ICPCs WEEKLY REPORT FROM 08/06 TO 14/06/2026', 'Weekly', 'MWIRIWE NDABASUHUJE CYANE MWESE AHO MURI HOSE.<div>NATWE I RUSIZI TUMEZE NEZA ,MUBUZIMA BUSANZWE GUSA KUBIJYANYE N\'AKAZI BIKOMEJE KUTAGENDA NEZA BITEWE N\'IFUNGWA RYIBYANGOMBWA BYO GUSARURA AMASHYAMBA NDETSE N\'IMIPAKA IHUZA URWANDA NDETSE NA CONGO BITYO UMUSARURO UKARUSHAHO KUGABANUKA ARIKO NABASHIJE KUVUGANA N\'ASARURA AMASHYAMBA BAMBWIRAKO BIGIYE GUHABWA UMURONGO KANDI HAKABA HARI AMAKURU KO BASHOBORA KONGERA GUFUNGURA IMIPAKA,TWIZEYE HAGIZE IGIHIINDUKA AKAZI KAKONGERA KUGENDA NEZA.</div><div>Murakoze</div>', '2026-06-19', '2026-06-19', 113, '2026-06-19 12:08:10', '2026-06-19 12:08:10', '13:55:00', '14:15:00', 'RUSIZI'),
