(873, 'NYAMASHEKE ICPCs WEEKLY REORT FRO 01/08/2026', 'Weekly', 'MWIRIWE&nbsp;<div>UKWEZI KWA KANAMA 2026,ICYUMWERU CYAMBERE KUVA KURI 01/08 TO 09/08/2026 ,MU KARERE KA NYAMASHEKE HABAYEHO IBINTU BIDASANZWE KUKO ABACURUZI BOSE BABAYE NKABABIVAMO KUBERAKO IMBAHO BACURUZAGA ZOSE ZISIGAYE ZIHABWA ABANYAKIGALI BIGATUMA&nbsp; ABABARANGUZAGA BARAHISE BABAZAMURA.</div><div>HARI UMUHANDA BAKORESHAGA UTARACAGAMO IMODOKA NINI BIKAGORA ABAJYANA I KIGALI KUHAGERA BITYO ABACURUZI BA NYAMASHEKE BAKAJYAN IMODOKA ZISHOBORA KUGERAYO NONEHO ABA KIGALI BAKAZA KUBAGURIRA NONE UBU BARIKUGERAYO BAGAHITA BABATWARA IMBAHO BAKARANGUYE NGO BACURUZE KANDI ZANAHISEKO ZIZAMUKA MU BICIRO BATASHOBORA</div>', '2026-08-10', '2026-08-10', 113, '2026-08-10 18:42:46', '2026-08-10 18:42:46', '20:28:00', '20:40:00', 'NYAMASHEKE'),
