(885, 'RUSIZI ICPCs DAILY REPORT ON 11/08/2026', 'Incident', 'MWIRIWE NEZA<div>UYUMUNSI BWIJE DUKOZE FACTURE YIMBAHO 100 ZA MADRIEN NAZO ZARI ZIJE GUSATURWA ARIKO BIFUJEKO BAZISOHOKANA AGAKIRIRO ZIFITE FACTURE YA EBM , UBWO NUBUNDI IKIBAZO KIRACYARI CYAKINDI IMBAHO ZIKOMEJE KUBURA MUTURERE TWACU.</div><div>ARIKO UWARI WAMBWIYEKO UYUMUSI AFI BUSORERE PLANCHE 300 UYUMUNSI NTIYAJE MUKAZI YANZEKO MUSORESHA ADAHARI KANDI NGO AMAFRANGA YARAFITE NTIYARI YUZUYE ANSABAKO NAZAGERA MUKAZI MPITAKO MUSORESHA.</div><div>MURAKOZE</div>', '2026-08-11', '2026-08-11', 113, '2026-08-11 21:27:02', '2026-08-11 21:27:02', '23:16:00', '23:30:00', 'RUSIZI-NYAMASHEKE'),
