(12, 17, NULL, 'Dear Olga, thank you for sharing the meeting minutes. I noticed a few points discussed during the meeting but not reflected in the minutes. Kindly find them below for your consideration. \r\n\r\nAdditional Resolutions (Previously omitted but discussed)\r\n\r\n10.	RWVCA Operational Flow update: HR & Administration, in collaboration with IT & Communication, are tasked with updating and improving the functionality of the RWVCA MIS.\r\n11.	Membership database enhancement: The existing membership database must be fully updated to include all necessary and accurate member details.\r\n12.	Member mobilization for production platform: Efforts must be strengthened to recruit and mobilize new members for the production platform.\r\n13.	AI Training Initiative: The association will explore and develop opportunities to provide AI training for RWVCA members.', 6, '2026-03-18 15:35:19', '2026-03-18 15:35:19'),
