(44, 259, NULL, 'Okay, we will continue addressing this in collaboration with the relevant institutions, with confidence that the issue will be resolved and productivity enhanced.', 7, '2026-04-08 09:56:14', '2026-04-08 09:56:14'),
(45, 289, NULL, 'Dear Rutayisire, \r\nUrakoze kohereza list ya Nyanza. Gusa ndabona hose mutujuje imibare yabakozi bazahabwa insurance kugirango tumenye umubare total uzava Nyanza, mwabisubiramo mukuzuza ibibura?\r\nMurakoze', 1, '2026-04-10 09:58:30', '2026-04-10 09:58:30'),
(46, 292, NULL, 'Dear IT, Thank you for your detailed report and for the technical support you provided to Odile. We appreciate your efforts in attempting to resolve the issue and your clear recommendation following the feedback from RRA.\r\nSince we are moving forward with this purchase, I would like to request that you advise and guide the Procurement team on the specific model to acquire. Please ensure the new device meets the key criteria it must be fully capable of running our QuickBooks software seamlessly.\r\nAs the management was decided that next time, we have to procure a device powerful enough that the employee will not require a laptop in addition to the iPad for their daily tasks. Please share the specific technical requirements with the with Procurement team.\r\nThank you again for your hard work and proactive support.\r\nBest regards,', 1, '2026-04-13 09:28:42', '2026-04-13 09:28:42'),
(47, 334, NULL, 'Manzi waramutse neza?\r\nUwo mucuruzi ni nde udashaka gutanga umusoro? Nonese amafaranga RWVCA imufitiye ni bwokoki?\r\nUmbwire uwo ariwe tubikurikirane tumenye ibyo aribyo.', 7, '2026-04-14 10:50:52', '2026-04-14 10:50:52'),
(48, 190, NULL, 'received', 73, '2026-04-16 07:24:30', '2026-04-16 07:24:30'),
(49, 319, NULL, 'KUKI UTAYOHEREREZA NA CHANTAL ?', 3, '2026-04-16 11:58:02', '2026-04-16 11:58:02'),
(50, 321, NULL, 'Weekly report', 108, '2026-04-16 14:19:40', '2026-04-16 14:19:40'),
(51, 321, NULL, 'Weekly report', 108, '2026-04-16 14:19:44', '2026-04-16 14:19:44'),
(52, 321, NULL, 'Weekly report', 108, '2026-04-16 14:19:44', '2026-04-16 14:19:44'),
(53, 321, NULL, 'Weekl', 108, '2026-04-16 14:20:34', '2026-04-16 14:20:34'),
(54, 292, NULL, 'Dear Procurement Team,  \r\nI am working on finding an iPad/Tablet specification compatible with Windows, as this will address the need for a device that also supports a SIM card. With this solution, laptops will no longer be necessary, and staff can simply connect to the POS via a Bluetooth printer. Once I complete the market research for this specification, I will provide it to you for further processing.  \r\nKindly,', 2, '2026-04-17 11:09:13', '2026-04-17 11:09:13'),
(55, 217, NULL, 'Dear Balaka,\r\nWe acknowledge receipt of your first quarterly report for 2026. Regarding the issue with KIAKA and their unpaid VAT since January, please let us know if you require support from the RWVCA Headquarters to resolve this matter. Furthermore, please remind all timber traders that it is mandatory to obtain an invoice whenever they purchase timber from suppliers.\r\nBest regards,\r\nHR', 1, '2026-04-20 08:30:18', '2026-04-20 08:30:18'),
(56, 391, NULL, 'well received with thanks.', 1, '2026-04-20 13:23:18', '2026-04-20 13:23:18'),
