(65, 473, NULL, 'Dear Ephta,\r\nWe have received your weekly report and we thank you. However, please remember that to submit reports on time, because delays prevent you from providing the daily report as well, since you still have pending ones.', 7, '2026-04-29 12:45:20', '2026-04-29 12:45:20'),
