(93, 887, NULL, 'Dear Emmanuel, Thank you and your team for the report, your commitment, and the fruitful work achieved during the activity. Regarding Rukara’s case, I encourage you to follow up with him to ensure that he fulfills the requirements requested by RRA. This will enable Jeanne to properly process the tax obligations when he purchases timber, as it is difficult to facilitate the taxation of timber purchases when the trader does not have a TIN. Thank you for your continued follow-up.', 1, '2026-08-13 12:39:09', '2026-08-13 12:39:09');
